project RELEASE_030:
  version 1
  title "perttool 0.3.0 Contract 4 beta release"
  description "Release suffix-free 0.3.0 beta from the accepted atomic Contract 4 source and one verified tarball. All six tasks and 19p completed over two active days. Release commit af445770e323efe374a17808fde20ec48a7d68cf is the peeled v0.3.0 target, and local, GitHub, and npm tarballs are byte-identical. After acceptance, the explicitly authorized dist-tag operation made beta=latest=0.3.0 while alpha remains 0.1.0-alpha.2. An unqualified global install and light Contract 4 smoke passed. The plan has no remaining or recommended task after advance."
  as_of 2026-07-26
  duration_unit point
  velocity 19p/2d
  finish RELEASE_030_ACCEPTED


